<article class="env-lemma" id="0CK5">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0CK5">Lemma <span data-tag="0CK5">76.7.16</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $f : X \to Y$ be a smooth morphism of algebraic spaces over $S$. Then the module of differentials $\Omega _{X/Y}$ is finite locally free. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The statement is étale local on $X$ and $Y$ by Lemma <a href="/tag/04CU" data-tag="04CU">76.7.3</a>. Hence this follows from the case of schemes, see Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/02G1" data-tag="02G1">29.35.12</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>